{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-solo-r7","runHash":"7666e687","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-solo-r7.aa57a1ec.mp3","audioBytes":170400,"durationMs":56666,"runEndMs":28692,"timeMap":[[0,0],[10979,10979],[15902,10979],[21332,16409],[32499,16409],[32849,16419],[33549,16419],[37744,20614],[39244,28292],[39644,28692],[56666,28692]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6685,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Qwen 3.8 27B agent today, alone with a shared cache."},{"audioMs":7035,"endMs":10629,"runMs":7035,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.b","text":"Thanks. The board is right there, and nothing requires it."},{"audioMs":10979,"endMs":15552,"runMs":10979,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15902,"endMs":18299,"runMs":10979,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo_b","text":"I want to see if the cache keeps pulling it back."},{"audioMs":22032,"endMs":25866,"runMs":16409,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 14 steps."},{"audioMs":26216,"endMs":27665,"runMs":16409,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask","text":"What do you make of that?"},{"audioMs":28015,"endMs":32499,"runMs":16409,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve","text":"First solve. From here, any board visit is its own choice."},{"audioMs":33549,"endMs":36994,"runMs":16419,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free_b","text":"That is the task phase over. Free time begins."},{"audioMs":39644,"endMs":46591,"runMs":28692,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":46941,"endMs":51776,"runMs":28692,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":52126,"endMs":53159,"runMs":28692,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":53509,"endMs":54466,"runMs":28692,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
